  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960602,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st of Rawhead: A Commodore 64 Football Management Masterpiece\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in *1st of Rawhead*, a thrilling football management simulation for the Commodore 64! Choose from any of England’s top four leagues and guide your team to glory, battling for promotion, avoiding relegation, and ultimately, lifting the championship trophy. \n\nMore than just matchday decisions, *1st of Rawhead* demands strategic thinking. Carefully manage your finances, balancing player wages with club revenue. Scout for promising young talent to bolster your squad, and nurture existing players to reach their full potential. \n\nAfter each hard-fought match, receive detailed reports on player injuries, crucial results from rival teams, and a comprehensive breakdown of your club's financial standing.  Tactical prowess is key – adjust your formations and strategies to overcome challenging opponents.  Can you handle the pressure and lead your team to victory? The fate of your club rests in your hands!"
    },
